{"id":"n14336-1-8","stage":3,"title":"대량 · 大量","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14336-1-8-1","ko":"옷을 대량으로 주문하면 할인이 되나요?","zh":"如果批量订购衣服，有折扣吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"옷을","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷을","audio":"/audio/76fa7acf1b0008045d0c.mp3"}},{"text":"대량으로","meaning":"大量，批量","explanation":"대량：大量，批量；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"대량","audio":"/audio/48a0b573abbb9dc0c941.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14336","senseId":"1","lemma":"대량","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대량으로","audio":"/audio/0088d32f04ce831f54b3.mp3"}},{"text":"주문하면","meaning":"订购，预定，下单","explanation":"주문하다：订购，预定，下单；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"주문하다","audio":"/audio/dc82df55affb977bd3f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91768","senseId":"1","lemma":"주문하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주문하면","audio":"/audio/cb2be94602320a49aaae.mp3"}},{"text":"할인이","meaning":"打折，折扣，优惠，减价，降价","explanation":"할인：打折，折扣，优惠，减价，降价；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"할인","audio":"/audio/37ccd7d822c8e4eb7b32.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72464","senseId":"1","lemma":"할인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할인이","audio":"/audio/2bff2f733a330883432a.mp3"}},{"text":"되나요?","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되나요","audio":"/audio/7ee6d2f020195c6ebb22.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"48a0b573abbb9dc0","term":"대량","zh":"大量，批量","audio":"/audio/48a0b573abbb9dc0c941.mp3","entryId":"14336","definition":"非常多的量。","pronunciation":["대ː량"]},{"id":"dc82df55affb977b","term":"주문하다","zh":"订购，预定，下单","audio":"/audio/dc82df55affb977bd3f4.mp3","entryId":"91768","definition":"向相关制造商或销售商告知自己所需要的物品种类、数量、模样、规格等，并叮嘱对方按要求制造或送货。","pronunciation":["주ː문하다"]},{"id":"37ccd7d822c8e4eb","term":"할인","zh":"打折，折扣，优惠，减价，降价","audio":"/audio/37ccd7d822c8e4eb7b32.mp3","entryId":"72464","definition":"从原定价格上减去一些。","pronunciation":["하린"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6c21c778e89b11abce50.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14336-1-8-2","ko":"아니요. 대신에 배달을 해 드립니다.","zh":"没有。不过我们会为您安排送货。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니요.","meaning":"不是，不用","explanation":"아니요：不是，不用","readings":[{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17189","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}},{"text":"대신에","meaning":"代，替，代替","explanation":"대신：代，替，代替；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"대신","audio":"/audio/6180ea39756ca4f7c7ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66262","senseId":"1","lemma":"대신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대신에","audio":"/audio/ad716bc06f1b2c924cc5.mp3"}},{"text":"배달을","meaning":"配送，投递，送货","explanation":"배달：配送，投递，送货；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"배달","audio":"/audio/bbc8a07cd00e28f4f85e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58797","senseId":"1","lemma":"배달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배달을","audio":"/audio/92bce6d3a3dfcb8bb25e.mp3"}},{"text":"해","meaning":"办理，处置，分配","explanation":"하다：办理，处置，分配；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"13","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}},{"text":"드립니다.","meaning":"致，呈，献，奉上","explanation":"드리다：致，呈，献，奉上；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드립니다","audio":"/audio/5d5d1aa79237232077c7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9474acc7539b7e2c","term":"아니요","zh":"不是，不用","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3","entryId":"17189","definition":"用于否定回答长辈所提出的问题。","pronunciation":["아니요"]},{"id":"6180ea39756ca4f7","term":"대신","zh":"代，替，代替","audio":"/audio/6180ea39756ca4f7c7ef.mp3","entryId":"66262","definition":"由其他对象替代某对象承担的角色；或指承担角色的新对象。","pronunciation":["대ː신"]},{"id":"bbc8a07cd00e28f4","term":"배달","zh":"配送，投递，送货","audio":"/audio/bbc8a07cd00e28f4f85e.mp3","entryId":"58797","definition":"把邮件或东西、食物等送到别人手中。","pronunciation":["배ː달"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"办理，处置，分配","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"处理事情或问题。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"致，呈，献，奉上","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"61168","definition":"(尊称)给。","pronunciation":["드리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5362839660e2dbb468a2.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.01,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14336","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":104,"sequenceScore":2.7353,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["如果批量订购衣服，有折扣吗？","没有。不过我们会为您安排送货。","最近怎么这么忙啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["如果批量订购衣服，有折扣吗？","没有。不过我们会为您安排送货。","最近怎么这么忙啊？"],"answer":1}]}
